# UniMate

### Your University. Your People.

UniMate is a student-only social platform designed for International Information Technology University (IITU) students in Almaty, Kazakhstan.

## Project Overview

UniMate aims to connect students, help them build friendships, discover campus places, and communicate within one university community.

## Core Features

- Student registration and university email verification
- Student profiles and interests
- Discover and search for students
- Friend requests and friendships
- Social feed with posts, likes, and comments
- Campus places map
- Private messaging
- Notifications
- Student privacy and content moderation

## Target Audience

Current students of International Information Technology University (IITU).

## Design

- Primary color: Burgundy `#A71930`
- Background: Light Gray `#F2F3F5`
- Cards: White `#FFFFFF`
